WEBVTT

00:07:27.568 --> 00:07:31.405
and we've been successful
because of these experiences,

00:07:31.405 --> 00:07:32.698
not in spite of.

00:07:33.616 --> 00:07:36.702
Corporations, we are your innovators.

00:07:36.744 --> 00:07:40.539
Give us opportunities to lead
beyond DE and I,

00:07:40.581 --> 00:07:43.125
in product development, marketing,

00:07:43.167 --> 00:07:45.085
finance and engineering.

00:07:45.085 --> 00:07:47.963
Go beyond your usual suspects.

00:07:48.005 --> 00:07:50.549
Take the time to see us

00:07:50.549 --> 00:07:54.845
and learn about our unique qualities
and lived experiences.

00:07:55.429 --> 00:07:57.806
We are your truth tellers, baby,

00:07:57.806 --> 00:07:58.807
(Deepa laughs)

00:07:58.849 --> 00:08:01.101
in a moment where it's time
to tell the truth.